# Your journal. Everything the app writes lives next to the code, and none of it
# belongs in the repo: this is a personal-data app, and the whole point of it is
# that the data stays on your machine. Copy the folder and you have copied your
# journal; clone the repo and you have copied only the app.

entries/
exports/
backups/
outbox/
browser-profile-clean/

app-settings.json
app-log.json
calendar-events.json
custom-choices.json
goals.json
goal-log.json
monthly-reviews.json
people.json
task-log.json
learn-list.json
